      "value": "You cannot show full title of worlds in social menu, there is no room for it.\nBut icons are useful because i cannot enter most private rooms. This should visible with small icons in which type room they are. Makes much easier to decide. \n\nAnd AFK icon should also useful.... because part of my friends are sleeping in rooms and they cannot invited or visited anyway.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
