      "value": "@{5bcbaf75fab2337b72ced6b0|full_name}: I think it is clear that a redesign of the social menu would be needed to support showing more data about a user in the main list.\n\nSeeing what world someone is in in the list of online users without having to click each one would be awesome.\n\nIt would also potentially mean fewer API calls since the main listing would not be reloaded as much with users returning to the main social menu over and over.​",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
