      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name}: Yes, this will reduce a lot traffic and many loading data for each user click. Also much faster to choose who you want invite to your world and who not.\n\nMay also have colored dots, like in Twitch, my idea is here:\nGreen = Available / can invited\nBlue = Busy / limited invite (can invited, but don't expect it i will come quick)\nYellow = Too busy / cannot invited (mostly for streamers, they have already own things / own rooms)\nPurple = AFK / Sleeping (You can enter room if room is set as Friendly or lower, but pay attention and/or keep in silence)\nRed = Don't disturb me! (Busy with dating or private matters, you cannot send requests at all!)\n\nColor dots will keep things clean and useful for all users. Is faster visible than icons. Useful for streamers to keep problems low.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
